                            {
                                "example_id": "51766c6c-cb1c-4db7-a2ff-a8b2677b3e27",
                                "sense_id": "4b04b9e3-ce7c-35d2-b95d-f62466cc7d4b",
                                "text": "It was only at the age of six years when Bismillah was sent to Varanasi to stay with his maternal uncle, Ali Baksh, who himself was a great musician and played shehnai in the premises of the Kashi Vishwanath Temple."
